00:22:33.840 --> 00:22:36.630
and online tutorials authored
by many of our engineers

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:38.550
at Google.

00:22:38.550 --> 00:22:41.830
Whether you are already using
Google Cloud or just starting,

00:22:41.830 --> 00:22:45.000
I hope we have inspired
you on your application,

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:48.480
modernization, and data-powered
